            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ni yaba atoshobora kuronka n’izo ntunguru zibiri cank’ ivyana vy’inuma bibiri, az’ azane ishikanwa ry’icaha yakoze, ry’ikigiracumi c’ingero yitwa efa y’ifu igogōretse: ariko ntaz’ ayisukekw amavuta, canke ngw ayishirekw imibavu, kukw ar’ ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aheze ayizanire umuherezi, na we ayikamatek’ urushi rumwe rwo kuba icibutso cayo, ayosereze ku gicaniro, ayishize ku bimazi nshikaniwe jewe Uhoraho, bigatōngōrwa n’ umuriro: kizoba ar’ ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo muherezi azoba amuhongeye ku caha yakoze ic’ ari co cose muri vya bindi bidōnzwe, na we azoharirwa: ifu isigaye iz’ ibe iy’ umuherezi, nk’uko bisanzwe biba kw ishikanwa rindi ry’amafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
